&lt;p style="position:absolute;top:281px;left:128px;white-space:nowrap" class="ft42"&gt;8. Toshtemirova S.A., &amp;amp; Ilmurodova F.S. Integrativ yondashuv asosida kasbiy fao-&lt;/p&gt;
